      "before": "<p><strong>Atefeh Anklet</strong> is elegant and timeless; it blends traditional charm with modern style. Perfect for any occasion, it’s a graceful addition to your jewelry collection.</p>\n<p><strong>Specifications:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Pazeb Length: </strong>10 inches</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Total Weight: </strong>100 grams</li>\n<li>\n<strong>What's In The Box:</strong> Pair of Pazeb</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Packaging: </strong>Packed in a secure air-tight pouch and an elegant branded box.</li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong>Care Instructions:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\">Apply perfume before wearing jewellery to prevent damage.</li>\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\">Avoid water exposure to protect against tarnishing.</li>\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\">Gently wipe your jewellery with a soft cloth after wearing to remove beauty or skincare products.</li>\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\">Keep your jewellery in an airtight pouch or box to prevent tarnishing and damage.</li>\n</ul>",
      "after": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Exuding grand traditional majesty and festive opulence, the <b>Atefeh Anklet</b> features a magnificent pair of statement kundan payals plated in a rich antique golden finish, intricately hand-set with a double row of uncut teardrop kundan stones, a double-strand seed pearl upper border, and lush cascading clusters of luminous pearls and seed pearls. Designed for weddings, grand festivities, and heritage trouseaus, they finish with bold heritage style.</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Features:</b></p>\n<ul style=\"margin-top: 0cm;\" type=\"disc\">\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\">\n<b>Type:</b> Statement Kundan Anklet</li>\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\">\n<b>Material:</b> Premium high-grade metal alloy base plated in a rich antique golden finish, hand-set with uncut teardrop kundan stones alongside luminous pearls and seed pearls.</li>\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\">\n<b>Design:</b> An elaborate traditional royal silhouette featuring a wide, articulated ankle band topped with a neat double-row seed pearl border, layered over two closely aligned rows of gold-bezel uncut teardrop kundan stones, and finished along the lower edge with rhythmic clusters of spherical pearls accented with tiny seed pearl tips.</li>\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\">\n<b>Aesthetic:</b> Royal Bridal, Traditional Heritage, Kundan &amp; Pearl Splendor, Royal Heritage Charm</li>\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\">\n<b>Anklet Length: </b>10 inches</li>\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\">\n<b>Weight: </b>100 grams</li>\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\">\n<b>What's in the Box:</b> 1 Pair of Anklets</li>\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\">\n<b>Packaging:</b> Packed in a secure air-tight pouch and an elegant Zeesy Jewellery signature branded box.</li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Care Instructions:</b> To maintain the beautiful shine of your jewelry, gently wipe it with a soft cloth after each wear. Avoid contact with water, harsh chemicals, or excessive moisture to preserve the piece's function and plating.</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs)</b></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Q1: What occasions is this anklet suitable for?</b></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>A:</b> This anklet is ideal for weddings, mehndi nights, nikah ceremonies, and grand festive celebrations. Its regal kundan and pearl cluster payal design completes bridal and traditional outfits beautifully.</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Q2: What outfit styles pair best with this anklet?</b></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>A:</b> The rich antique golden finish, gleaming teardrop kundan setting, and lush pearl cluster fringes complement bridal lehengas, ghararas, traditional sarees, and heavy festive formals effortlessly.</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Q3: What are these pieces made of, and are they skin-friendly?</b></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>A:</b> They are crafted from a premium high-grade metal alloy base and finished with careful attention to detail. Designed for comfortable wear, the materials are selected to be gentle on the skin for most wearers during regular use.</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Q4: What makes the design of this anklet unique?</b></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>A:</b> It features a classic royal heritage layout combining a double-strand seed pearl top trim and two tiers of articulated teardrop kundan stones with dense pearl-and-seed-pearl cluster drops along the lower border.</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Q5: What is the delivery time and authenticity guarantee?</b></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>A:</b> Delivery across Pakistan takes 3-5 working days. Every Zeesy piece is quality-checked to ensure premium craftsmanship and brand authenticity.</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Also known as:</b> atefeh anklet | kundan and pearl bridal payal | antique golden jhanjar anklets | pakistani bridal foot jewelry | dulhan kundan payal | festive wedding anklets | zaivari | shaadi ka set | zeesy anklet</p>"
    },
